const PREP={"in":["in",["در","تو","توی"],"place open thing"],"on":["on",["روی","رو","بر روی"],"surface"],"under":["under",["زیر"],"surface"],"behind":["behind",["پشت"],"place open"],
"next to":["next to",["کنار","پهلوی"],"surface open"],"in front of":["in front of",["جلوی","جلو","مقابل"],"place open"],"inside":["inside",["داخل","توی","درون"],"place"]};
const PREP_OBJ={place:["A1:house; home","A1:room","A1:school","A1:car","A1:shop","A1:park","A2:garden"],open:["A1:door","A1:window","A1:house; home","A1:car"],
  surface:["A1:table","A1:chair","A1:bed","A1:car"],thing:["A1:bag"]};
